<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86309" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρεσβ-ϋτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like an old man, elderly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					787
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακὰ π.</span> the evils <i>of
				age,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				270
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				2.34
			</span></i> (vulg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρεσβυτιδίου</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; ἕλκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					<u>Eup.</u>
					1.172
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄδουσαι μέλος π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					278
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδιά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					685a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ στρυφνοὶ καὶ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1158a2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχαῖον λίαν καὶ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Fab.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ τι περιεργότερον καὶ πρεσβυτικώτερον
					εἰρήκαμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					4.13
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Thes.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρεσβυτικόν, τό,</span>
			<i>hall of the elders, senate-house,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Milet.
				7.60
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Didyma</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sardis</u>
				7(1).8.72
			</span></i>.</div>
